| Two busy threads in a Wimp task for 20 s while other tasks run.
| Have Alarm, a clock or Organizer running. Nothing else should crash, and
| the box must say PASS: both threads counted more than 0 (5.0.3.1).
| With LoadTicker first, the TickerStats line must end via=module.
Set UST$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set UnixLib$TickerStats <Wimp$ScrapDir>.TickerStats
WimpSlot -min 8000K
Run <UST$Dir>.tickertest -s 20
